'''Pumpkin Pie''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 2,800 [[coins]]{{Currency|Coin}} and then claiming it from the interactive tier system during the [[Thanksgiving Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The whole knife takes the design of a slice of pumpkin pie, hence the name. Its blade is made out of pumpkin filling with four swirls of frosting laid on it. On the spine of the blade is therounded jagged lighter shaded crust of the pie. The guard continues the crust, and the handle is made out of pumpkin like the blade with some jagged crust on it.

==Trivia==
*This is one of the first Thanksgiving themed weapons to be introduced to the game.
*It uses the mesh of the [[Default Knife]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

